stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> WAITING: workflow task
  [*] --> QUEUED: fire, run-now, redrive
  WAITING --> QUEUED: upstream tasks succeeded
  WAITING --> UPSTREAM_FAILED: upstream failed
  QUEUED --> RUNNING: lock and claim
  QUEUED --> SKIPPED: too late
  RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED
  RUNNING --> DELAYED: retryable failure
  DELAYED --> QUEUED: due again
  RUNNING --> QUEUED: lease expired, not sent
  RUNNING --> DEAD_LETTERED: retries exhausted
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  DEAD_LETTERED --> [*]
  SKIPPED --> [*]
  UPSTREAM_FAILED --> [*]
